{% from "../components/picture/picture.nunj" import picture %}

<div class="about-slider" data-about-slider>
	<div class="about-slider__section-wrapper">
		<section class="about-slider__section" data-slide>
			<div class="about-slider__col _first">
				<h1 class="about-slider__title h2 ttu _anim-first" data-animation="words">
					<span class="word-wrapper"><span class="word">О нас</span></span>
				</h1>
				<p class="about-slider__text _first p1" data-animation="fade-right">Смысл нашей работы &mdash; сделать так, чтобы вы&nbsp;осмелились на&nbsp;вершину своей мечты.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="about-slider__col _full-height _second">
				<div class="about-slider__logo-placeholder" data-lottie-autoplay-trigger></div>
				<div class="about-slider__logo-img" data-lottie-autoplay="false" data-lottie-animation="/assets/jsons/about-slider-logo.json"></div>
				<p class="about-slider__text _second s1">Мы&nbsp;станем надежным спутником в&nbsp;ваших путешествиях. Поможем сделать их&nbsp;интересными и&nbsp;безопасными и&nbsp;поделимся своим опытом.</p>
				<div class="img-wrapper _full-height" data-animation="height">
					<div class="img-wrapper__img">
						<picture>
							<source srcset="/assets/images/about/slider/about-slider-1.webp, /assets/images/about/slider/about-slider-1@2x.webp 2x" type="image/webp">
							<img
								class="about-slider__img _first"
								src="/assets/images/about/slider/about-slider-1.jpg"
								srcset="/assets/images/about/slider/about-slider-1@2x.jpg 2x"
								width="1360"
								height="776"
								alt=""
								aria-hidden="true"
							>
						</picture>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="about-slider__col _full-screen-width _third">
				<figure class="about-slider__quote">
					<blockquote class="about-slider__quote-text h4 ttu">Мы&nbsp;болеем горами и&nbsp;надеемся заразить ими&nbsp;вас</blockquote>
					<figcaption class="about-slider__quote-author h6 ttu">Сергей Зон-Зам</figcaption>
				</figure>
				<div class="img-wrapper" data-animation="height">
					<div class="img-wrapper__img">
						{{ picture({
							className: 'about-slider__img _second',
							path: '/assets/images/about/slider/about-slider-2',
							ext: 'jpg',
							width: 768,
							height: 490
						}) }}
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>
	</div>
</div>
